OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran presented with
OL,4,AFreedom of City
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork's last surviving Normandy veteran
OL,7,Fhas been given Freedom of the City at a
OL,8,Fspecial ceremony in his honour.
OL,10,FNow 101, Ken Cooke was only 18 and
OL,11,Fworking at Rowntree's sweet factory
OL,12,Fwhen he was conscripted to take part in
OL,13,Fthe D-Day landings on 6 June 1944.
OL,15,FCity of York Council unanimously voted
OL,16,Fin favour of granting him the highest
OL,17,Fhonour the authority can bestow in
OL,18,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
