OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran presented with
OL,4,AFreedom of City
OL,5,
OL,6,FCooke, who has written a book about his
OL,7,Fexperiences of war, said: "I want to
OL,8,Fmake sure that young people know about
OL,9,Fwhat I went through. It's up to them to
OL,10,Fmake sure it doesn't happen again."
